%% Bibliography for the talk "Agentic AI impact on the IT industry"
%%
%% Built 2026-11-17 from the research notes in
%%   research_notes/Agentic AI impact on IT industry/*.md
%% Updated 2026-11-18 from the "Bibliography additions needed" sections of
%%   insights/I1..I11 (new entries, corrections, merged duplicates, file fields).
%% 1046 entries, one per source, deduplicated across the notes and insight files.
%% The insight files, the report and the slides cite by key: [@key].
%% references_keymap.tsv maps key -> url, title, notes files, insight files.
%% references_cited.bib holds only the 567 entries cited in insights/.
%%
%% key       authorYYYYkeyword, lowercase ASCII. For organisations the
%%           organisation is the author; for press the journalist's surname
%%           where the notes give it, otherwise the outlet. No year in the
%%           key when the notes give no publication date.
%% title     in [square brackets] when the notes record no exact title: the
%%           bracketed text is a description, not the published title.
%% keywords  research strand(s): 1.analysts, 2.benchmarks, 3.labour,
%%           4.economics, 5.industry, 6.security, 7.telegram; plus `cited`
%%           when the entry is cited in at least one insight file.
%% note      "verified: <level>; interest: <publisher's interest>", then
%%           remarks, then "title: ..." when the title is not the exact one
%%           or was taken from a local copy or from the URL slug.
%%           Levels, best one reported by any notes or insight file:
%%             primary             the source itself was read
%%             abstract only       only the abstract of the paper was read
%%             secondary           read in secondary coverage
%%             search-result only  seen only as a search-engine extract
%%             memory only         mirror or prior knowledge, not seen
%%             not opened          link listed (mostly from the Telegram
%%                                 chat) but never opened
%%             not stated          the notes give no verification tag
%%             metadata from memory, unverified
%%                                 classic reference added from general
%%                                 knowledge, not read in this project
%%           Anything below "primary" is checked before it reaches a slide.
%% file      local converted copy, path relative to this folder
%%           (converted/reports/ or converted/web/), where one exists.
%%           Further copies are named in the note ("other local copies").
%% urldate   2026-11-17 for every entry (date of the research session).
%%
%% Metadata comes only from the notes, the insight files and the local
%% converted copies. Missing author, date or title means it was not recorded.
%% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

